      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(246,243,237,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">From Manson to Chelan Butte, we keep deep hillside wells pumping for lake homes, vineyards, and vacation rentals. No water? We answer 24/7.</p>
